{'symbol': 'NEE', 'date': '2022-01-01 09:00:00', 'title': "FPL COMPLETES INTEGRATION OF GULF POWER; EXPANDS AMERICA'S BEST ENERGY VALUE TO NORTHWEST FLORIDA", 'text': 'JUNO BEACH, FLA., JAN. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FLORIDA POWER & LIGHT COMPANY AND GULF POWER COMPANY HAVE INTEGRATED AND ARE NOW DOING BUSINESS AS FLORIDA POWER & LIGHT COMPANY IN NORTHWEST FLORIDA.'}